#. (itstool) path: ul/li
msgid ""
"Mapping of gamepads/joystick buttons to: keyboard buttons, mouse buttons and "
"moves, scripts, executables and macros consisting of elements mentioned here."
msgstr ""

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
msgid "Assigning multiple switchable sets of mappings to gamepad."
msgstr ""

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
msgid "Auto profiles - assign profile to active application window."
msgstr ""

#. (itstool) path: ul/li
msgid ""
"Reads existing .amgp profiles, and imports settings from an installed "
"AntiMicroX on first run."
msgstr ""

#. (itstool) path: description/p
msgid ""
"RevivalPad is a modified fork of AntiMicroX 3.6.1, which was itself inspired "
"by QJoyPad. Problems with this build should be reported to the RevivalPad "
"issue tracker, not to the AntiMicroX maintainers."
msgstr ""

